#!/usr/bin/python3
"""Fail-closed host controller for the frozen native C2B2a qualification.

This file is intentionally specific to the accepted Stage C2B2a repair.  It is
not a general command runner.  Every child crosses the same
sandbox-exec -> /usr/bin/env -i boundary, every executable is selected by an
absolute path supplied in the independently reviewed authority argv, and every
mode belongs to the closed phase table below.

The controller has no provider, VM, payload-runtime, datastore, daemon, or
adapter mode.  It never invokes a shell and never resolves an executable via
PATH.  Inputs that cannot be proved by the closed filesystem and evidence
contracts cause a terminal error.
"""

